# Run first: kubectl port-forward deploy/query-deployment 4002:4002
@host = http://localhost:4002

### PostCreated
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PostCreated",
  "data": { "id": "p1", "title": "First post" }
}

### CommentCreated
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CommentCreated",
  "data": { "id": "c1", "content": "great post !", "postId": "p1", "status": "pending" }
}

### CommentUpdated
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CommentUpdated",
  "data": { "id": "c1", "content": "great post !", "postId": "p1", "status": "approved" }
}

### Get all posts with comments
GET {{host}}/posts
